! CLEAN removing particles past 2 standard deviations in x, t and delta: the host's centroids and
! deviations of the copied columns, the test on the device. Must be identical
Q1: QUAD, L=0.1, K1=0.5
D: DRIF, L=0.2
R: RFCA, L=0.1, VOLT=2e6, PHASE=80, FREQ=2.856e9
CL: CLEAN, MODE="stdeviation", XLIMIT=2, TLIMIT=2.2, DELTALIMIT=2.5
BL: LINE=(Q1, D, R, D, CL, D)
